<title>USA: Ticketmaster acquires Tennessee unit.</title>
<headline>Ticketmaster acquires Tennessee unit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticketmaster Group Inc Thursday said it has acquired the 20 percent of Ticketmaster-Tennessee Inc it did not already own.</p>
<p>Ticketmaster now owns 100 percent of the regional ticket company selling about 750,000 tickets per year in greater Memphis and parts of Arkansas and Louisiana.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;This transaction is another step in Ticketmaster's strategy of consolidating our core ticketing business,&quot; Fredric Rosen, chief executive officer, said in a statement.</p>
